Description:

A schedule-outbox free/busy POST that names more than one local attendee, or
names the same local attendee more than once, now evaluates each attendee
against a freshly emptied availability set.  Previously the per-request
free/busy filter's VAVAILABILITY array was freed after the first attendee but
its length and pointer were left in place, crashing the CalDAV worker on a
double free.


